# Real farm data. Backups carry movements, contracts, prices and the bank
# details out of Settings, and this repo is public — a backup that gets
# committed is public the moment it is pushed, and stays in the history even
# after it is deleted. Never track one.
backup.json
*backup*.json
grainflow-backup*.json
.env
.env.*

# Real feedyard data. The Grassdale seed and the spreadsheet answers it is
# checked against carry named suppliers, contract numbers and prices. The
# feedlot page and tests use them when they are here and fall back to the
# anonymised demo seed when they are not.
private/
